    <string name="guide_badge_format">GAME GUIDE • %1$d / 4</string>
    <string name="guide_step1_title">1. Explore All 16 Levels</string>
    <string name="guide_step1_desc">Advance through the worlds by tapping the numbered circles on the path. Earn at least 1 star to unlock the next level and reach the Final Castle.</string>
    <string name="guide_step2_title">2. Trivia &amp; Word Puzzles</string>
    <string name="guide_step2_desc">You have 3 lives and 15 seconds per question. Choose an option and tap Check, or tap scrambled letter tiles to form the secret word.</string>
    <string name="guide_step3_title">3. Cave &amp; Interactive Monsters</string>
    <string name="guide_step3_desc">Tap the Challenge Cave for a Quick Challenge of 10 random questions, and tap monsters on the map to discover hints and zone progress.</string>
    <string name="guide_step4_title">4. Chests, Medals &amp; Your Bank</string>
    <string name="guide_step4_desc">Earn surprise chests by winning stars, and create or edit your own custom questions in the Questions tab.</string>
